         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Vector illustration. Light bulb. Idea symbol. Cartoon funny sticker in comic style with contour. Decoration for your greeting cards, posters, patches and prints for clothes, flyers, emblems</rdf:li>
